@startuml
title Current backend | Student document and decision | FR-002/019
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Student as U
actor Administrator as A
participant Gateway as G
participant "Student Verification" as V
database "student_verification schema" as D
participant "S3-compatible MinIO" as S
participant "Shared relay / RabbitMQ" as E
U -> G: POST /api/student-verifications/documents
G -> V: Authenticated upload metadata
V -> V: Sign presigned PUT URL (S3 Signature V4)
V -> D: Create owned document metadata
V --> U: documentId + upload URL
U -> S: PUT document bytes using presigned URL
U -> G: POST /api/student-verifications\ndocumentId + schoolName + major
G -> V: SubmitStudentVerificationUseCase
V -> D: Check effective submission + document owner\nCreate Pending; attach metadata
note over V,S: Submission checks metadata ownership.\nDiagram does not assert an object-existence check in this use case.
A -> G: POST /api/student-verifications/:id/decision
G -> V: Administrator identity
V -> V: Pending-only; reject requires reason
V -> D: Decision + outbox in own transaction
V --> A: Approved / Rejected view
E -> D: Poll committed outbox
E -> E: Publish; idempotent consumers update own trust projections
note over V,E: Live Class now projects verified flag into its own teacher_verified table.
@enduml
